text:
The previous gen pro used to have this weird tick where if you ask it a reasonably open ended question, it would number things in the response and assign each one some weird label starting with &#x27;The...&#x27;<p>e.g.<p><pre><code>    X: The Parameters
    Y: The &quot;System&quot;
    Z: The &quot;Ongoing Grind&quot;
</code></pre>
The first two prompts I tested in AI Studio does the same, unfortunately.<p>Another quite unpleasant tick was that if you specify a peculiar term in your prompt as a conversational shortcut, it would keep repeating that throughout the conversation. e.g. &quot;...What is a bitter lesson pilled way to do this?&quot;, then you&#x27;d see it will quote &quot;bitter lesson pilled&quot; at like 7 places in its response. This one seems to have eased off a little.
